  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiwa Initiative Pacific: Nature-Based Solutions for Climate Change Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity provides funds to support Agence Fran&#xe7;aise de D&#xe9;veloppement (AFD) to implement the &apos;Kiwa Initiative: Nature-based Solutions for Climate Resilience&apos;, which&#xa0;will make Pacific Islands ecosystems, economies and communities more resilient to the impacts of climate change by&#xa0;increasing access to funding for nature-based solutions&#xa0;for local and national authorities, regional and civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
